Implement customer order confirmation email alongside existing admin notification when orders are placed.

## Changes

- **Customer confirmation email**: Send to customer using template `template_v2md02b` after admin email succeeds
- **XSS protection**: Add `escapeHtml()` helper to sanitize product data in email HTML templates
- **Error handling**: Customer email failure doesn't block order completion—user gets alert but order proceeds

```javascript
// Send admin notification first
const adminResponse = await emailjs.send('service_e14q4pw', 'template_a1t1vju', templateParams);

// Then send customer confirmation (failure is non-fatal)
try {
    const customerResponse = await emailjs.send('service_e14q4pw', 'template_v2md02b', customerEmailParams);
} catch (customerEmailError) {
    console.error('Customer email failed, but order was placed:', customerEmailError);
    alert('Order placed successfully! Note: There was an issue sending your confirmation email.');
}
```

